# NOTICE

This project is built on top of [AgentClinic](https://github.com/samuelschmidgall/AgentClinic)
(MIT License, © 2024 Samuel Schmidgall), which provides the upstream research
baseline: the clinical scenario data format (MedQA / NEJM case files), the
original patient–doctor–measurement agent protocol, and the benchmark CLI
(`agentclinic.py`).

MedConsult extends that baseline into a production-oriented, local-first
medical multi-agent consultation platform: web workspaces, a persistent local
document library with RAG retrieval, medical calculator tools, session memory,
a prompt pool, and multi-provider LLM bridging.

